        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an alien treasure hunter of the far future</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the journey of treasure hunter sisters, Millie and Merang, who have come to find the relics of the abandoned planet 'Earth'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the camera with the WASD keys and aim with the mouse. Click to fire your weapon. Wipe out all the monsters on the battlefield and keep Merang safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Weapons</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 20 unique weapons. A variety of playstyles makes every game feel new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase permanent upgrades with the money earned from defeating monsters! Don't give up; consistent upgrades will make you stronger.</p>",
